Hi!<br><br>Kromaia is a game developed with Bullet and Ogre that is getting close to final release. You can find complete information about the game on our Indiegogo campaign and get early access to the game very soon:<br><a href="http://igg.me/at/Kromaia/" class="postlink">http://igg.me/at/Kromaia/</a><br><br>You can see our crowdfunding video here:<br><a href="http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yyUmq3n3xS8&amp;hd=1" class="postlink">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yyUmq3n3xS8&amp;hd=1</a><br><br>And some screenshots too:<br><br><img src="http://www.krakenempire.com/kromaia/pk/Kromaia-PK-00_1024x576.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br><img src="http://www.krakenempire.com/kromaia/pk/Kromaia-PK-03_1024x576.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br><img src="http://www.krakenempire.com/kromaia/pk/Kromaia-PK-18_1024x576.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br><img src="http://www.krakenempire.com/kromaia/pk/Kromaia-PK-04_1024x576.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br><img src="http://www.krakenempire.com/kromaia/pk/Kromaia-PK-11_1024x576.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br>Bullet works perfectly in our unconstrained world with objects with incredible sizes and masses and every object that moves does it applying physical forces, including your own ship and all the hostile creatures.<br><br>Feel free to share our campaign with your contacts <img class="smilies" src="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/images/smilies/icon_wink.gif" width="15" height="15" alt=";)" title="Wink"><br><a href="http://igg.me/at/Kromaia/" class="postlink">http://igg.me/at/Kromaia/</a><br><br>Thank you for your support! <img class="smilies" src="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/images/smilies/icon_biggrin.gif" width="15" height="15" alt=":D" title="Very Happy"><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=6295">Antodologo</a> — Fri Sep 27, 2013 5:12 pm</p><hr />
